  <!-- 2. ENTERPRISE SOLUTIONS: THE 3 UNSOLVED OBSTACLES -->
  <section class="section-container bg-obsidian-elevated" id="solutions">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-kicker">Enterprise Solutions</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Overcome the 3 Unsolved Enterprise Migration Obstacles</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Enterprise migrations stall not because of moving raw storage bits, but because of what happens <em>around</em> the infrastructure. <span class="dcouplr-brand-tag"><span class="tag-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="tag-name">dcouplr</span><span class="tag-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> acts as the hermetic control plane brain that eliminates manual IaC rewrites, observability blind spots, and network collisions with zero WAN data egress.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="solution-cards-grid">
      <!-- Obstacle 1 -->
      <div class="solution-card card-elevated">
        <div class="solution-header">
          <div class="solution-icon-wrap">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline>
              <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="solution-badge">Eliminates 3–6 Mos</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="solution-title">1. Zero Manual IaC Rewrites</h3>
        <div class="solution-challenge">
          <strong>The Obstacle:</strong> Manually converting legacy Terraform HCL, CloudFormation, or bespoke deployment scripts to target cloud templates takes quarters of expensive Systems Integrator consulting.
        </div>
        <p class="solution-benefit">
          <strong>The Solution:</strong> Automated in-memory compilation translates legacy configurations directly into standardized OpenTofu HCL and cloud-native landing zones (AWS, GCP, Azure) in milliseconds.
        </p>
        <div class="solution-impact">
          <span>⚡ 100% Deterministic &bull; Zero Hallucinations</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Obstacle 2 -->
      <div class="solution-card card-elevated card-amber">
        <div class="solution-header">
          <div class="solution-icon-wrap" style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25); color: #fbbf24;">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"></path>
              <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line>
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="solution-badge" style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: #fde047; border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);">Saves $100k+ Labor</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="solution-title">2. Zero Observability Blind Spots</h3>
        <div class="solution-challenge" style="border-left-color: #f59e0b;">
          <strong>The Obstacle:</strong> Rebuilding hundreds of proprietary vendor alert monitors in the destination cloud leaves teams completely blind during migration cutovers, risking P1 outages.
        </div>
        <p class="solution-benefit">
          <strong>The Solution:</strong> Mathematical query transpilation preserves complex multi-window rate transforms and thresholds into open-source Prometheus Alertmanager rules and Grafana 11 Unified Alerting.
        </p>
        <div class="solution-impact" style="color: #fbbf24;">
          <span>🎯 Unbroken Monitoring Before, During &amp; After Cutover</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Obstacle 3 -->
      <div class="solution-card card-elevated card-emerald">
        <div class="solution-header">
          <div class="solution-icon-wrap" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25); color: #34d399;">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="solution-badge" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #6ee7b7; border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);">Zero Code Changes</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="solution-title">3. Zero IP &amp; Network Collisions</h3>
        <div class="solution-challenge" style="border-left-color: #10b981;">
          <strong>The Obstacle:</strong> Hardcoded legacy IP addresses and overlapping CIDR blocks cause network collisions and application failures when workloads land in modern cloud VPCs.
        </div>
        <p class="solution-benefit">
          <strong>The Solution:</strong> In-VPC private DNS resolution (<code>*.mesh.internal</code>) and seamless kernel redirection eliminate hardcoded IP dependencies without recompiling application binaries.
        </p>
        <div class="solution-impact" style="color: #34d399;">
          <span>🔒 Seamless Wave Cutover with Instant Fallback</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. HOW IT WORKS: 3-STEP ENTERPRISE WORKFLOW -->
  <section class="section-container bg-obsidian-base" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-kicker">Enterprise Workflow</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">High-Velocity Migration in 3 Hermetic Steps</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Deploy <span class="dcouplr-brand-tag"><span class="tag-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="tag-name">dcouplr</span><span class="tag-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> inside your private security perimeter in under two minutes. Execute end-to-end cloud migrations without external dependencies or third-party data egress.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-steps-container">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="workflow-step-card card-elevated">
        <div class="step-badge-num">01</div>
        <h3 class="workflow-step-title">Discover &amp; Map (100% In-VPC)</h3>
        <p class="workflow-step-desc">
          The <span class="dcouplr-brand-tag"><span class="tag-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="tag-name">dcouplr</span><span class="tag-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> CLI scans local source infrastructure configurations, network dependencies, and alert policies directly in volatile RAM.
        </p>
        <ul class="workflow-features-list">
          <li>Zero outbound cloud network calls</li>
          <li>In-memory sensitive token anonymization</li>
          <li>Full inventory graph generation</li>
          <li>Automated compliance verification</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="workflow-step-card card-elevated">
        <div class="step-badge-num">02</div>
        <h3 class="workflow-step-title">Transpile &amp; Synthesize</h3>
        <p class="workflow-step-desc">
          Automated compilation generates clean OpenTofu landing zones and maps legacy monitor logic to standard Prometheus Alertmanager and Grafana 11 Alerting.
        </p>
        <ul class="workflow-features-list">
          <li>Standard OpenTofu HCL generation</li>
          <li>100% mathematical query equivalence</li>
          <li>Multi-cloud target support (AWS, GCP, Azure)</li>
          <li>Automated pre-flight syntax validation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="workflow-step-card card-elevated">
        <div class="step-badge-num">03</div>
        <h3 class="workflow-step-title">Orchestrate &amp; Cut Over</h3>
        <p class="workflow-step-desc">
          Orchestrates cloud-native block replication engines (AWS MGN, GCP M4CE, Azure Migrate) with zero IP collisions and automated rollback guarantees.
        </p>
        <ul class="workflow-features-list">
          <li>Continuous block-level disk synchronization</li>
          <li>Automated staged wave scheduling</li>
          <li>Instant live rollback safeguard</li>
          <li>Continuous parity and telemetry health checks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. ENTERPRISE VALUE PILLARS -->
  <section class="section-container bg-obsidian-elevated" id="benefits">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-kicker">Enterprise Value</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Engineered for Uncompromising Security, Data Isolation &amp; Cost Certainty</h2>
