      <h2 class="section-title">Centralized Cloud Ingestion vs. Zero-Egress In-VPC Decoupling</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Compare the architectural and operational boundaries of centralized multi-tenant cloud telemetry against zero-egress, predictable in-VPC compilation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-table-wrapper card-elevated">
      <table class="comparison-table" aria-label="Architecture Comparison Table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="th-param">Evaluation Vector</th>
            <th scope="col" class="th-saas">Centralized Cloud Ingestion Model</th>
            <th scope="col" class="th-dcouplr"><span class="dcouplr-brand-tag"><span class="tag-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="tag-name">dcouplr</span><span class="tag-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> Zero-Egress Mesh Model</th>
            <th scope="col" class="th-benefit">Enterprise Impact</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="td-param">Cost Architecture</td>
            <td class="td-saas">Volumetric ingest billing ($/GB + custom metric surcharges)</td>
            <td class="td-dcouplr"><strong>Predictable transparent node licensing</strong> ($300/mo, $1,500/mo, $3,500/mo, $45/node)</td>
            <td class="td-benefit">70% &ndash; 90% TCO reduction as telemetry scales</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="td-param">Query Portability</td>
            <td class="td-saas">Closed query syntax with platform-bound evaluation semantics</td>
            <td class="td-dcouplr"><strong>Lossless AST compilation</strong> to open standard PromQL &amp; Grafana YAML</td>
            <td class="td-benefit">Zero vendor migration friction</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="td-param">Data Privacy &amp; Egress</td>
            <td class="td-saas">Telemetry payloads, hostnames, and IP tags egress to external clouds</td>
            <td class="td-dcouplr"><strong>100% in-memory processing</strong> with local token scrubbing</td>
            <td class="td-benefit">Compliance ready (GDPR, HIPAA, SOC 2)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="td-param">Process Footprint</td>
            <td class="td-saas">High-overhead host daemons consuming 200MB+ RAM per node</td>
            <td class="td-dcouplr"><strong>Distroless container</strong> running under 50MB RSS memory</td>
            <td class="td-benefit">Minimal host CPU and memory overhead</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="td-param">Failure Isolation</td>
            <td class="td-saas">Multi-tenant cloud outages cause monitoring blind spots</td>
            <td class="td-dcouplr"><strong>Embedded Raft consensus ring</strong> with local telemetry mirror</td>
            <td class="td-benefit">Independent in-VPC operation</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

