            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0;">How Paid Customers Download &amp; Activate <span class="dcouplr-wordmark"><span class="dcouplr-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="dcouplr-text">dcouplr</span><span class="dcouplr-bracket">/&gt;</span></span></h3>
